1
00:01:15,795 --> 00:01:19,333
The Sniffy Octopus

2
00:01:36,349 --> 00:01:37,726
It's like this sure enough.

3
00:01:37,750 --> 00:01:39,058
What's the matter?

4
00:01:39,085 --> 00:01:41,929
Seems someone has been
tracing me recently.

5
00:01:41,955 --> 00:01:43,866
And maybe it's a girl.

6
00:01:47,894 --> 00:01:50,966
How could a girl trace you?

7
00:01:51,030 --> 00:01:54,204
Even you put the earth upside down,
such thing won't happen.

8
00:01:59,372 --> 00:02:01,613
Watch over carefully!

9
00:02:15,154 --> 00:02:16,132
Jaiko

10
00:02:16,155 --> 00:02:18,465
Gian's little sister.

11
00:02:28,134 --> 00:02:31,138
I'm so scared, really scared!

12
00:02:31,204 --> 00:02:34,378
But why did Jaiko trace me?

13
00:02:34,407 --> 00:02:35,909
Really incredible.

14
00:02:35,975 --> 00:02:38,285
It can't be that she likes me?

15
00:02:38,311 --> 00:02:40,291
No...impossible!

16
00:02:40,346 --> 00:02:42,952
That mustn't be like this.

17
00:02:43,850 --> 00:02:46,126
Hello!

18
00:02:46,152 --> 00:02:49,133
Nobita, you're really a happy guy!

19
00:02:49,188 --> 00:02:51,099
Happy? What did you mean?

20
00:02:51,124 --> 00:02:54,867
What? You're pretending! You guy!

21
00:02:55,261 --> 00:02:57,207
What? Jaiko, she...

22
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:58,903
likes me?

23
00:02:58,965 --> 00:03:01,844
It's normal for you to be surprised.
I'm surprised too.

24
00:03:01,868 --> 00:03:05,145
In fact Jaiko has been unusual recently.

25
00:03:05,171 --> 00:03:09,984
She always suspired alone.
And only ate 5 bowls of rice.

26
00:03:10,009 --> 00:03:12,649
She's my favorite little sister.
So I'm really worried about her.

27
00:03:12,712 --> 00:03:14,316
But I dare not ask her why.

28
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:19,159
Then when I opened her drawer,
what do you guess I saw?

29
00:03:20,019 --> 00:03:21,555
My picture?

30
00:03:21,621 --> 00:03:22,759
How could it be?!

31
00:03:22,822 --> 00:03:25,359
There's been nothing like
that appearing till now.

32
00:03:25,425 --> 00:03:27,871
It's just a girl's love.

33
00:03:28,594 --> 00:03:30,699
She's the same shy as me.

34
00:03:30,763 --> 00:03:32,834
Even she likes someone,
she dare not tell him.

35
00:03:32,899 --> 00:03:37,109
Once I think of that she's getting
in trouble, I'll feel sorry for her.

36
00:03:37,603 --> 00:03:41,415
So I hope you could ask her for a date
first.

37
00:03:41,441 --> 00:03:43,079
What?

38
00:03:44,210 --> 00:03:45,712
Jaiko

39
00:03:45,778 --> 00:03:48,452
Nobita said that he got something to
talk with you.

40
00:03:48,481 --> 00:03:51,257
So I'll go back to my room
in order to not disturb you.

41
00:03:51,284 --> 00:03:53,924
You should treat her softly. See you.

42
00:03:53,987 --> 00:03:55,898
What do you plan to tell me?

43
00:03:55,922 --> 00:03:57,959
What do I plan to tell you?
It really bothers me too.

44
00:03:58,024 --> 00:03:59,435
I'm very busy.

45
00:03:59,459 --> 00:04:01,564
If you haven't anything, just go home!

46
00:04:02,862 --> 00:04:05,843
Feels relaxed! But it seems
that I've been teased.

47
00:04:06,699 --> 00:04:08,645
Shizuka

48
00:04:09,068 --> 00:04:09,978
Nobita

49
00:04:10,003 --> 00:04:11,539
Shizuka, where are you going?

50
00:04:11,604 --> 00:04:13,880
I'm going to the park to forage feed.

51
00:04:13,906 --> 00:04:15,283
I'm going too.

52
00:04:15,308 --> 00:04:17,379
I'm back to get some feed. Wait for me!

53
00:04:17,443 --> 00:04:18,922
Shizuka...My favorite...

54
00:04:18,945 --> 00:04:20,322
<i>He'!</i>

55
00:04:20,346 --> 00:04:21,723
Gian

56
00:04:21,748 --> 00:04:23,125
Where are you going?

57
00:04:23,149 --> 00:04:25,823
What where to go? Jaiko called me back.

58
00:04:25,885 --> 00:04:27,887
Then you're going home?

59
00:04:27,954 --> 00:04:29,865
Why don't you understand a girl's heart?

60
00:04:29,889 --> 00:04:32,597
She always shows cool to who she likes.

61
00:04:32,658 --> 00:04:36,504
It should be that the boy lays bare to
her. To tell her that you like her.

62
00:04:36,529 --> 00:04:38,600
How could it be?! I don't like her.

63
00:04:38,664 --> 00:04:40,268
You mean that you hate her?

64
00:04:40,333 --> 00:04:41,744
I warn you!

65
00:04:41,768 --> 00:04:45,011
I won't forgive the boy
who makes my sister to cry!

66
00:04:45,038 --> 00:04:46,449
I like her, very much!

67
00:04:46,472 --> 00:04:48,509
You like her so much?!

68
00:04:52,345 --> 00:04:55,121
Look at me as Jaiko,
and say to me 'I like you'!

69
00:04:55,148 --> 00:04:56,149
What?

70
00:04:56,215 --> 00:04:57,819
Hurry!

71
00:04:57,884 --> 00:04:58,988
Jaiko...

72
00:04:59,052 --> 00:05:01,396
You couldn't say it since you didn't
look at me as Jaiko.

73
00:05:01,421 --> 00:05:06,302
Hurry to say 'Jaiko, I like you'!
Once more!

74
00:05:06,325 --> 00:05:08,965
Miss Jaiko, would you like to make friend
with me?

75
00:05:09,028 --> 00:05:10,564
Is it okay?

76
00:05:12,732 --> 00:05:15,474
Say it from your bottom of heart!

77
00:05:15,501 --> 00:05:17,913
I like you...l like you very much.

78
00:05:17,937 --> 00:05:20,008
Then show your attitude.

79
00:05:20,073 --> 00:05:22,713
Come closer! Hold the hands.

80
00:05:23,142 --> 00:05:26,351
I like you very much for sure!

81
00:05:26,379 --> 00:05:29,417
Do you love me?

82
00:05:29,482 --> 00:05:31,894
Of course I love you,
I love you very much.

83
00:05:31,918 --> 00:05:33,397
Really?

84
00:05:33,453 --> 00:05:35,194
Of course.

85
00:05:36,789 --> 00:05:38,735
Doraemon

86
00:05:38,758 --> 00:05:40,635
Doraemon, why could it become
like this?

87
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:44,836
My future bride should be Shizuka! Right?

88
00:05:44,897 --> 00:05:48,310
Can't be that my fate will be changed?

89
00:05:48,334 --> 00:05:52,282
At beginning you should marry Jaiko
by your fate.

90
00:05:52,338 --> 00:05:54,443
But it'll be changed hardy.

91
00:05:54,507 --> 00:05:56,748
And to change to be original.

92
00:05:57,643 --> 00:06:00,089
I don't want, Doraemon!

93
00:06:00,113 --> 00:06:02,115
I don't want to marry Jaiko.

94
00:06:02,181 --> 00:06:05,458
Help me, I like Shizuka more!

95
00:06:06,419 --> 00:06:08,296
The Sniffy Octopus

96
00:06:08,321 --> 00:06:11,768
To stick down the Octopus' ink will
make Jaiko to hate you.

97
00:06:11,791 --> 00:06:14,795
But its efficacy will be very strong.

98
00:06:14,861 --> 00:06:17,102
It doesn't matter.
Hurry to spray it to me right now.

99
00:06:17,130 --> 00:06:18,768
Doesn't it matter? I'll leave you alone.

100
00:06:18,831 --> 00:06:20,435
Hurry to spray it to me, more!

101
00:06:24,871 --> 00:06:26,214
It's okay!

102
00:06:26,239 --> 00:06:28,344
Then Jaiko will hate me...

103
00:06:28,841 --> 00:06:32,618
You always get me in trouble.

104
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,815
Hurry to go!

105
00:06:34,881 --> 00:06:36,827
Really effective!

106
00:06:36,849 --> 00:06:38,692
Hey, Nobita.

107
00:06:39,719 --> 00:06:41,562
It's on the nose to meet you here.

108
00:06:41,587 --> 00:06:43,692
I got something to tell you.

109
00:06:43,756 --> 00:06:47,533
I made a mistake to think that
Jaiko likes you.

110
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,506
I've asked her carefully.
But it's so funny in the end.

111
00:06:49,529 --> 00:06:51,509
Jaiko wants to become a cartoonist.

112
00:06:51,531 --> 00:06:54,102
But her works didn't be admitted
for many times.

113
00:06:54,167 --> 00:06:55,737
So she's very angry.

114
00:06:55,801 --> 00:06:59,112
Then she wants to draw some funny
cartoon adopting you as a model.

115
00:06:59,138 --> 00:07:00,845
So she traced you and looked at your
picture.

116
00:07:00,873 --> 00:07:03,854
She wants to draw a funny face of you.

117
00:07:08,114 --> 00:07:11,755
Don't know why, I feel very angry
suddenly seeing your face.

118
00:07:12,385 --> 00:07:14,524
It's because Yoo...because of Yoo.

119
00:07:14,587 --> 00:07:17,329
Get off my back!

120
00:07:18,357 --> 00:07:21,099
Idiot! My lover is still Shizuka.

121
00:07:21,127 --> 00:07:22,367
What?!

122
00:07:22,395 --> 00:07:24,671
Shizuka, wait for me!

123
00:07:24,697 --> 00:07:25,732
Shizuka

124
00:07:25,798 --> 00:07:27,744
I hate you! I hate Nobita!

125
00:07:27,767 --> 00:07:31,715
Don't say so, please like me!

126
00:07:31,737 --> 00:07:33,148
Shizuka

127
00:07:33,172 --> 00:07:36,153
He's really a unlucky dog!

128
00:07:36,209 --> 00:07:37,711
Shizuka

129
00:07:43,216 --> 00:07:47,187
With the almighty camp you'll
have a great camping.

130
00:07:48,387 --> 00:07:50,867
To come back from the future which
you haven't been for a long time.

131
00:07:53,092 --> 00:07:55,072
Nobita, I'm back...

132
00:07:55,595 --> 00:07:57,506
Strange, he's not in.

133
00:08:06,505 --> 00:08:07,984
Nobody is in?

134
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,610
Are they in the kitchen?

135
00:08:10,977 --> 00:08:13,014
Nobita, Mom!

136
00:08:14,046 --> 00:08:17,391
It's the Rice Cracker, I'm eating!

137
00:08:20,486 --> 00:08:24,434
For Doraemon, we've went to camp.

138
00:08:24,457 --> 00:08:25,731
How could it be?!

139
00:08:25,758 --> 00:08:30,298
When I come back to the future, the
whole family have went to camp!

140
00:08:30,363 --> 00:08:31,501
Good...

141
00:08:31,564 --> 00:08:34,408
Nothing different without me!

142
00:08:35,301 --> 00:08:37,781
Forget it, let me forgive them!

143
00:08:37,803 --> 00:08:40,181
Didn't they come back yet?

144
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:43,179
We're home!

145
00:08:43,242 --> 00:08:45,381
Doraemon, I nearly can't stand...

146
00:08:46,312 --> 00:08:48,451
What's wrong?

147
00:08:48,514 --> 00:08:51,120
There's the rubbish everywhere
on the hill.

148
00:08:51,183 --> 00:08:54,426
The empty canisters and paper abandoned
by people were everywhere.

149
00:08:54,453 --> 00:08:58,902
They're very noisy in the other camp.
Adding the noise of the car engine...

150
00:08:58,924 --> 00:09:00,460
we couldn't sleep at night at all!

151
00:09:00,526 --> 00:09:02,904
Just like what I said.

152
00:09:03,462 --> 00:09:06,375
I won't go camping anymore!

153
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:08,208
What a pity!

154
00:09:08,801 --> 00:09:12,248
Next time I'll take you to have a great
camp!

155
00:09:12,271 --> 00:09:15,718
If it's just camp, that's unnecessary.

156
00:09:15,741 --> 00:09:18,312
I have the almighty camp!

157
00:09:18,377 --> 00:09:22,223
A new invention of the 22nd century.

158
00:09:22,248 --> 00:09:24,057
Really?

159
00:09:24,083 --> 00:09:26,654
I don't want to come back so upset
like this time!

160
00:09:26,719 --> 00:09:28,027
No problem!

161
00:09:28,054 --> 00:09:30,898
Believe me! Let's fly to there
by the bamboo dragonfly.

162
00:09:33,025 --> 00:09:34,663
Because it's a wonderful camp.

163
00:09:34,727 --> 00:09:37,173
Let's call Shizuka to go together with
us.

164
00:09:37,196 --> 00:09:38,675
Okay!

165
00:09:39,899 --> 00:09:41,936
Shizuka

166
00:09:43,903 --> 00:09:46,144
It's Nobita and Doraemon.

167
00:09:46,172 --> 00:09:49,312
We'll go camping.
Shizuka, just go with us!

168
00:09:49,375 --> 00:09:50,319
But...

169
00:09:50,343 --> 00:09:52,823
Just imagine that you've been cheated.
Let's go!

170
00:09:57,817 --> 00:10:00,559
Show a little happy, please!

171
00:10:01,253 --> 00:10:03,255
Look! We can see the valley!

172
00:10:03,322 --> 00:10:05,427
Really!

173
00:10:05,858 --> 00:10:07,701
It's better over there.

174
00:10:10,229 --> 00:10:13,267
So I'll take out my camp.

175
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:15,701
This one?

176
00:10:15,768 --> 00:10:16,803
Seems like a kennel.

177
00:10:16,869 --> 00:10:18,314
No problem!

178
00:10:21,707 --> 00:10:23,983
So enter to have a look!

179
00:10:26,178 --> 00:10:28,658
Really troublesome!
Just being pulled here by him.

180
00:10:33,586 --> 00:10:36,567
We're now in the camp?

181
00:10:36,589 --> 00:10:39,035
It's early for you to be surprised.

182
00:10:39,992 --> 00:10:42,529
As long as you press these buttons,
it'll become many kinds of rooms.

183
00:10:42,595 --> 00:10:44,871
Let's try!

184
00:10:45,631 --> 00:10:47,076
The floor becomes very soft.

185
00:10:47,099 --> 00:10:48,874
Feels like the carpet.

186
00:10:49,568 --> 00:10:51,548
It comes out from the floor,

187
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:53,880
and will become a beautiful living room,
right'?

188
00:10:53,906 --> 00:10:56,147
Awesome!

189
00:10:56,842 --> 00:11:00,415
Pressing this button, the wall will
become crystal.

190
00:11:04,717 --> 00:11:08,665
And, pressing this button...

191
00:11:08,721 --> 00:11:11,065
What's wrong...

192
00:11:12,591 --> 00:11:15,071
It'll become the View Flat.

193
00:11:15,094 --> 00:11:16,164
What a beautiful sightseeing!

194
00:11:16,228 --> 00:11:19,607
Having the Bento here must be very
joyful.

195
00:11:19,632 --> 00:11:22,408
I forgot to bring something.

196
00:11:22,435 --> 00:11:24,415
And the drink.

197
00:11:25,838 --> 00:11:29,115
Don't worry, because it's an almighty
camp.

198
00:11:29,975 --> 00:11:31,511
Delivery Kiosk

199
00:11:31,577 --> 00:11:32,817
Just tell me what would you like to
eat'?!

200
00:11:32,878 --> 00:11:33,879
Ramen

201
00:11:33,946 --> 00:11:35,926
Curry rice

202
00:11:38,117 --> 00:11:40,097
Awesome!

203
00:11:41,687 --> 00:11:43,257
You can listen to the music too.

204
00:11:43,322 --> 00:11:47,429
Because of the isolator, no matter how
loud we cry, they can't hear it.

205
00:11:47,493 --> 00:11:49,029
Too great!

206
00:11:49,628 --> 00:11:51,699
I want the fruit juice.

207
00:11:51,764 --> 00:11:53,505
Cola is very cool, not bad!

208
00:11:53,532 --> 00:11:54,875
And also the ice-cream, pudding...

209
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:56,573
You've ordered too many things!

210
00:11:56,602 --> 00:11:58,639
All of us need pay for that.

211
00:11:58,704 --> 00:12:00,706
Not free?

212
00:12:02,441 --> 00:12:04,352
You can't litter the rubbish everywhere.

213
00:12:04,376 --> 00:12:06,151
Gosh!

214
00:12:06,178 --> 00:12:08,658
You should press this button
at this time.

215
00:12:12,852 --> 00:12:15,833
The rubbish which is picked up will
be sent back to home.

216
00:12:17,289 --> 00:12:19,826
Pressing this button,
it'll become the bedchamber.

217
00:12:21,327 --> 00:12:23,432
Pressing this...

218
00:12:24,396 --> 00:12:26,034
It'll become the bathroom.

219
00:12:26,098 --> 00:12:28,442
Very capacious, feels very comfortable.
YEP!

220
00:12:29,802 --> 00:12:32,578
It's nearly time to play outside.

221
00:12:32,605 --> 00:12:35,279
There're many toys too.

222
00:12:35,341 --> 00:12:37,252
Look!

223
00:12:39,345 --> 00:12:42,326
Really interesting...

224
00:12:42,381 --> 00:12:45,385
It's a lake, let's go over there.

225
00:12:48,354 --> 00:12:49,992
It's so good to come here, right?

226
00:12:50,055 --> 00:12:52,001
Too great!

227
00:12:52,892 --> 00:12:54,894
I got a fish...

228
00:12:56,629 --> 00:12:59,200
Doraemon, what's about you?
Are you ok?

229
00:13:02,434 --> 00:13:03,572
Strange!

230
00:13:03,636 --> 00:13:06,845
What, such a little fish!

231
00:13:10,376 --> 00:13:12,515
Ya...

232
00:13:12,578 --> 00:13:15,058
<i>Great! ...</i>

233
00:13:17,216 --> 00:13:19,696
It became very crowded here.

234
00:13:19,718 --> 00:13:23,666
It's nearly time for us to go back to
our camp.

235
00:13:39,972 --> 00:13:43,351
Is...who didn't turn off the button?

236
00:13:44,710 --> 00:13:48,157
It seems to be collecting all
the rubbish in the mountain.

237
00:13:50,516 --> 00:13:52,860
That's said,

238
00:13:55,454 --> 00:13:57,957
I have something to do in the future.

239
00:13:58,023 --> 00:13:59,502
It's 1:00 dirty!

240
00:13:59,525 --> 00:14:01,004
Doraemon, you can't do that!

241
00:14:01,026 --> 00:14:02,027
You can't get away!

242
00:14:02,094 --> 00:14:03,971
Nobita

243
00:14:10,436 --> 00:14:14,282
Take the Pluto!

244
00:14:21,914 --> 00:14:22,858
What?

245
00:14:22,881 --> 00:14:24,724
Let's take the Pluto to Kyushu.

246
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:27,162
Yes, really very comfortable!

247
00:14:27,186 --> 00:14:28,688
The bed is very placid.

248
00:14:28,754 --> 00:14:31,735
The light in the street is just like
the arrows passing by the window.

249
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:34,794
The stars in the sky at night are
very beautiful.

250
00:14:34,860 --> 00:14:37,602
The terminus is Miyazaki of Kyushu.

251
00:14:37,663 --> 00:14:39,734
That means you're at the seaside of
Kyushu.

252
00:14:39,798 --> 00:14:41,778
Swimming here enjoys myself to the full.

253
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:43,211
So it is, very right!

254
00:14:43,235 --> 00:14:46,216
The seaside of Kyushu is really
beautiful. And very interesting.

255
00:14:47,039 --> 00:14:49,576
Really envy it!

256
00:14:50,309 --> 00:14:52,255
The Pluto!

257
00:14:52,277 --> 00:14:54,621
It's just the new trunk line!

258
00:14:54,647 --> 00:14:59,187
Mom, sleeping at the different places
occasionally should be something happy.

259
00:14:59,251 --> 00:15:03,028
Why should we pay money for sleeping
on the train?

260
00:15:03,055 --> 00:15:07,003
If you want to sleep at another place,
just go to sleep in the ambry.

261
00:15:07,359 --> 00:15:11,398
Well, it's very hot, so I want to
go swimming by the Pluto.

262
00:15:11,463 --> 00:15:15,309
If you want to go swimming,
there's a swimpool nearby.

263
00:15:15,334 --> 00:15:18,110
You needn't go so far specially.

264
00:15:22,641 --> 00:15:25,622
No way! So we have no choice
but to go to the swimpool.

